description: Advisory triage for a pipeline issue — reads title/body/labels/comments and recommends PATH A (docs-only), B (standard), or C (multi-task). Posts a `## Classification` comment; does NOT modify labels. Usage: /classify-issue <issue_number>
disable-model-invocation: false
